 Letter • Three professional references with contact information: address, phone number, and email address Optional Documents • Samples of current artwork • Samples of student artwork • If contacted for an interview, please be prepared to share sample syllabi, professional work, and student work. Seton Hall University is committed to programs of Equal Employment Opportunity (EEO). Advertised: 31 Oct 2022 Eastern Daylight Time Applications close: Back to search results Apply now Refer a friend Whatsapp Facebook LinkedIn Email App"
